semseg.manifestê*{"created": "2026-11-23T13:02:36", "model_name": "FKAConv", "checkpoint": "tiny CI test model (random init, no checkpoint)", "config": "fkaconv_parislille3d.yml with base_width=4 (tiny CI model)", "onnx_file": "tiny_fkaconv.onnx", "inputs": [{"name": "points", "dtype": "float32", "shape": ["batch", 3, "num_points"], "layout": "[B, 3, N] input point coordinates"}, {"name": "features", "dtype": "float32", "shape": ["batch", 3, "num_points"], "layout": "[B, 3, N] input features (feature_mode=xyz)"}, {"name": "sp0", "dtype": "float32", "shape": ["batch", 3, 256], "layout": "[B, 3, 256] support points of stage 0 (FPS, stage_npoints[0]=256)"}, {"name": "sp1", "dtype": "float32", "shape": ["batch", 3, 64], "layout": "[B, 3, 64] support points of stage 1 (FPS, stage_npoints[1]=64)"}, {"name": "sp2", "dtype": "float32", "shape": ["batch", 3, 16], "layout": "[B, 3, 16] support points of stage 2 (FPS, stage_npoints[2]=16)"}, {"name": "sp3", "dtype": "float32", "shape": ["batch", 3, 4], "layout": "[B, 3, 4] support points of stage 3 (FPS, stage_npoints[3]=4)"}, {"name": "idx0", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", "num_points", 16], "layout": "[B, num_points, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx1", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", "num_points", 16], "layout": "[B, num_points, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx2", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 256, 16], "layout": "[B, 256, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx3", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 256, 16], "layout": "[B, 256, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx4", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 64, 16], "layout": "[B, 64, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx5", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 64, 16], "layout": "[B, 64, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx6", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 16, 16], "layout": "[B, 16, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx7", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 16, 16], "layout": "[B, 16, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx8", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 4, 16], "layout": "[B, 4, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx9", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 4, 16], "layout": "[B, 4, 16] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx10", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 16, 1], "layout": "[B, 16, 1] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx11", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 64, 1], "layout": "[B, 64, 1] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx12", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", 256, 1], "layout": "[B, 256, 1] neighbor indices into the source point set"}, {"name": "idx13", "dtype": "int64", "shape": ["batch", "num_points", 1], "layout": "[B, num_points, 1] neighbor indices into the source point set"}], "output": {"name": "logits", "dtype": "float32", "shape": ["batch", "num_points", "num_classes"], "layout": "[B, N, num_classes] per-point logits; argmax over last axis = label"}, "in_channels": 3, "num_classes": 9, "ignored_label_inds": [0], "num_points": 4096, "dynamic_axes": {"batch": true, "num_points": true}, "opset": 17, "versions": {"torch": "2.6.0+cu126", "onnx": "1.23.2", "onnxruntime": "1.23.2", "onnxruntime_available_providers": ["TensorrtExecutionProvider", "CUDAExecutionProvider", "CPUExecutionProvider"]}, "providers": ["CUDAExecutionProvider", "CPUExecutionProvider"], "adapter": {"stage_npoints": [256, 64, 16, 4], "num_neighbors": 16, "feature_mode": "xyz", "hierarchy": {"description": "FKAConv multi-scale hierarchy computed in preprocessing (FKAConv._compute_hierarchy): support points per stage via FPS (stage_npoints), KNN indices (num_neighbors) between consecutive levels plus self-KNN, and nearest-neighbor (K=1) indices for upsampling. idx order: [self(N,K), self(N,K), down/up pairs..., upsample (S2,1),(S1,1),(S0,1),(N,1)]."}}, "preprocessing": {"description": "FKAConv preprocessing; replicate in C++ (hierarchy = FPS + KNN, see meta.json).", "voxel_size": 0.08, "num_points": 4096, "channels": 3, "shift_min": false, "augment": {"recenter": {"dim": [0, 1, 2]}}, "feature_columns": [], "steps": ["1. voxel-grid subsample the raw cloud at `voxel_size` (barycenter per voxel), keeping a nearest-neighbor map proj_inds back to the original cloud", "2. sliding window (regular sampler, as in the original inference): repeat until min(possibilities) > 0.5 \u2014 center each patch at argmin(possibilities) (the least-covered point), sample k=num_points nearest neighbors via KDTree, update possibilities[idxs] += (1 - dist/max_dist)^2, run the model, accumulate test_probs[idxs] = 0.95*test_probs[idxs] + 0.05*softmax(logits)", "3. inside each patch: apply the eval augmentation (recenter) from the training config, then build input features per feature_mode='xyz' with in_channels=3 (FKAConv._build_features)", "4. compute the hierarchy (FKAConv._compute_hierarchy): FPS support points at stage_npoints=[256, 64, 16, 4], KNN indices with K=16", "5. feed points [1,3,k], features [1,C,k], sp_i [1,3,S_i], idx_i [1,S,K] (int64)", "6. final labels = argmax(test_probs)[proj_inds]"]}, "labels": {"values": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "names": ["ground", "building", "pole-road_sign-traffic_light", "bollard-small_pole", "trash_can", "barrier", "pedestrian", "car", "natural-vegetation"]}}